1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,693
A farmer

2
00:00:01,693 --> 00:00:05,713
threw a dead donkey into a dry well.

3
00:00:06,303 --> 00:00:09,497
Smelling it, eighty rats

4
00:00:09,497 --> 00:00:11,139
jumped down.

5
00:00:11,474 --> 00:00:13,225
When the meat ran out,

6
00:00:13,225 --> 00:00:16,055
they realized they were trapped.

7
00:00:16,692 --> 00:00:20,575
Hunger turned them against each other.

8
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:23,277
Two weeks later,

9
00:00:23,306 --> 00:00:25,976
only one was still alive.

10
00:00:26,505 --> 00:00:29,729
The farmer released it into his field.

11
00:00:30,032 --> 00:00:32,799
Now it didn't eat grain —

12
00:00:33,009 --> 00:00:36,054
it hunted only its own kind.

13
00:00:36,316 --> 00:00:37,384
This is

14
00:00:37,433 --> 00:00:39,654
the "rat-wolf" game.

15
00:00:39,913 --> 00:00:43,626
Those who start it never get their hands dirty:

16
00:00:43,793 --> 00:00:45,012
the ones below

17
00:00:45,012 --> 00:00:47,520
destroy each other themselves.

18
00:00:47,808 --> 00:00:49,122
And you —

19
00:00:49,122 --> 00:00:51,942
aren't you in someone else's well?

20
00:00:52,193 --> 00:00:54,028
Don't fight inside —

21
00:00:54,028 --> 00:00:57,034
look for the way up.

22
00:00:57,575 --> 00:00:58,950
Subscribe.

